	(text "Boot button on IO0 to force into\nthe ROM bootloader in case the USBC\nroute does not work reliably."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 242.062 38.862 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0283cbcc-3224-44f1-b3b5-4d461d2b8ca9")
	)
	(text "This ferrite might optionally be a 0Ohm link\ndepending on what the shield to ground connectivity\nis in this USB C connector. Gives us options."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45.974 121.412 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "4e2518a1-7f1a-4483-a8db-c8d042b47edd")
	)
	(text "Reset circuit provides a short hold low on the \nenable pin during power up to ensure power rails\nare stable before allowing boot. A switch is \nadded for convenience during development."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 86.614 24.892 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify right)
		)
		(uuid "72eb9ba0-66e0-4820-a09a-f2d679d184c8")
	)
	(text "Pull down for known state and ~100ms RC filter\ndriven by a push-pull GPIO. The receiver just needs\n100 Ohms directly into a pin so it's not adding \nmore load with its own pull downs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 217.932 150.876 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "973ba3cd-a700-4e97-ab96-d75a4e2c09a2")
	)
	(text "TVS protection specifically for USB"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 111.252 94.488 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b5fdf516-db5e-4f41-89b7-b18b96bc39e5")
	)
	(text "USBC\n- CC pins pulled to ground individually indicates a sink.\n- ESP32 implements the 45Ohm data line resistors and pull ups internally.\n- Route data lines as short, length matched (<0.5mm diff) \n  differential pair on same layer, no vias.\n- Not using the sideband signals\n- Not using VBus aside from sensing its presence with a divider down to 3.3ish volts"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 107.696 90)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "eb359141-f816-47ad-8653-403b50d286e5")
	)
